<title>UK: Novartis says 85 projects in development.</title>
<headline>Novartis says 85 projects in development.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss life science company Novartis AG said on Tuesday it currently had 85 pharmaceutical projects in clinical development.</p>
<p>&quot;That is a very substantial portfolio,&quot; Novartis president Daniel Vasella told a news conference.</p>
<p>Vasella added that the newly-merged group planned to launch 29 new products in the next three years.  </p>
<p>Company officials also said Novartis was &quot;in advanced discussions with potential buyers&quot; for 14 branded over-the-counter drugs in the U.S.. The company declined to give further details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
